· Neutral analysis correctly identifies the sequence’s structure: a brief transient followed by an exact, stable period‑4 cycle.
· The lens adds a theoretical layer by categorising the cycle as a Scar (persistent structure from a failed merge). Most AIs agree on Split, Tension, Failed Merge, and Scar; the main disagreement is whether a stable cycle counts as a Scar (Perplexity says no). This is a conceptual nuance worth clarifying.
